silm:instances_papers_15_chapters_03_sections_01_concrete_anchor_2#classdomesticcat silm:hasLongDescription "The ClassDomesticCat is DomesticCat (the stage-1 refinement). In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Class^{(1)}', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
